@startuml
title UC-CO Collect a fee and deposit it (cohort P, E)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
autonumber
actor "Collecting officer" as ROLE_COLLECTOR
boundary "Collecting officer" as B_UNIT_NGA_COLL
control "check (not stated)" as C_not_stated_ROLE_COLLECTOR
entity "record" as E_S_FEE_DUE
participant "Collecting officer" as N_UNIT_NGA_COLL
entity "record" as E_S_CASH_ON_HAND
entity "Agency own systems" as E_SYS_AGENCY_OWN
participant "Depository banks" as N_INST_AGDB
participant "Accounting unit" as N_UNIT_NGA_ACC
actor "Authorized government deposit…" as ROLE_AGDB
boundary "Depository banks" as B_INST_AGDB
control "check (not stated)" as C_not_stated_ROLE_AGDB
entity "record" as E_S_AGDB_BAL
participant "NGCDS" as N_SYS_NGCDS
actor "Chief accountant (head of the…" as ROLE_ACCOUNTANT
boundary "Accounting unit" as B_UNIT_NGA_ACC
control "check (not stated)" as C_not_stated_ROLE_ACCOUNTANT
participant "Treasury Single Account" as N_ACC_TSA
actor "Bureau of the Treasury" as ROLE_BTR
boundary "NGCDS" as B_SYS_NGCDS
control "check (not stated)" as C_not_stated_ROLE_BTR
participant "eTRAMS" as N_SYS_ETRAMS
boundary "BTr" as B_INST_BTR
participant "National agency" as N_INST_NGA
actor "Agency as a whole (central of…" as ROLE_AGENCY
boundary "National agency" as B_INST_NGA
control "check (not stated)" as C_not_stated_ROLE_AGENCY
participant "BTr" as N_INST_BTR
== CO-01 Pay the fee ==
ROLE_COLLECTOR -> B_UNIT_NGA_COLL : System or office where the act takes place
B_UNIT_NGA_COLL -> C_not_stated_ROLE_COLLECTOR : Pay the fee
C_not_stated_ROLE_COLLECTOR -> E_S_FEE_DUE : use: A fee is due from a payer (order of payment issued)
C_not_stated_ROLE_COLLECTOR -> N_UNIT_NGA_COLL : F064 Fee paid to the collecting officer
== CO-02 Issue the official receipt ==
ROLE_COLLECTOR -> B_UNIT_NGA_COLL : System or office where the act takes place
B_UNIT_NGA_COLL -> C_not_stated_ROLE_COLLECTOR : Issue the official receipt
note right of C_not_stated_ROLE_COLLECTOR : R-OR-IMMEDIATE: A numbered official receipt is issued immediately for each…
C_not_stated_ROLE_COLLECTOR -> E_S_CASH_ON_HAND : write: Collections in the hands of the collecting officer
C_not_stated_ROLE_COLLECTOR -> E_SYS_AGENCY_OWN : write: Official receipt issued and listed
== CO-03 Deposit the collections in full ==
ROLE_COLLECTOR -> B_UNIT_NGA_COLL : System or office where the act takes place
B_UNIT_NGA_COLL -> C_not_stated_ROLE_COLLECTOR : Deposit the collections in full
note right of C_not_stated_ROLE_COLLECTOR : R-DEPOSIT-NEXT-DAY: Collections are deposited in full not later than the next b…
C_not_stated_ROLE_COLLECTOR -> E_S_CASH_ON_HAND : use: Collections in the hands of the collecting officer
C_not_stated_ROLE_COLLECTOR -> N_INST_AGDB : F049 Collections deposited at the depository bank
== CO-04 Report collections and deposits for the day ==
ROLE_COLLECTOR -> B_UNIT_NGA_COLL : System or office where the act takes place
B_UNIT_NGA_COLL -> C_not_stated_ROLE_COLLECTOR : Report collections and deposits for the day
C_not_stated_ROLE_COLLECTOR -> E_SYS_AGENCY_OWN : use: Official receipt issued and listed
C_not_stated_ROLE_COLLECTOR -> N_UNIT_NGA_ACC : F050 Report of collections and deposits, at accounting
== CO-05 Credit the account and report ==
ROLE_AGDB -> B_INST_AGDB : System or office where the act takes place
B_INST_AGDB -> C_not_stated_ROLE_AGDB : Credit the account and report
C_not_stated_ROLE_AGDB -> E_S_AGDB_BAL : write: Collections in the account at the depository bank
C_not_stated_ROLE_AGDB -> N_SYS_NGCDS : F051 Collection reports of the bank, at NGCDS
C_not_stated_ROLE_AGDB -> N_UNIT_NGA_ACC : F065 Consolidated report of daily collections and credit memo, a…
== CO-06 Record the collections ==
ROLE_ACCOUNTANT -> B_UNIT_NGA_ACC : System or office where the act takes place
B_UNIT_NGA_ACC -> C_not_stated_ROLE_ACCOUNTANT : Record the collections
C_not_stated_ROLE_ACCOUNTANT -> E_SYS_AGENCY_OWN : write: Collections recorded in the books of the agency
== CO-07 Transfer the balances to the TSA ==
ROLE_AGDB -> B_INST_AGDB : System or office where the act takes place
B_INST_AGDB -> C_not_stated_ROLE_AGDB : Transfer the balances to the TSA
C_not_stated_ROLE_AGDB -> E_S_AGDB_BAL : use: Collections in the account at the depository bank
C_not_stated_ROLE_AGDB -> N_ACC_TSA : F052 Balances on their way to the TSA
== CO-08 Consolidate the collection reports ==
ROLE_BTR -> B_SYS_NGCDS : System or office where the act takes place
B_SYS_NGCDS -> C_not_stated_ROLE_BTR : Consolidate the collection reports
C_not_stated_ROLE_BTR -> N_SYS_ETRAMS : F053 Collections data at eTRAMS
== CO-09 Issue the certificate of deposited collections ==
ROLE_BTR -> B_INST_BTR : System or office where the act takes place
B_INST_BTR -> C_not_stated_ROLE_BTR : Issue the certificate of deposited collections
C_not_stated_ROLE_BTR -> N_INST_NGA : F054 Certificate of deposited national collections, at the agency
== CO-10 Report revenue and other receipts (FAR 5) ==
ROLE_AGENCY -> B_INST_NGA : System or office where the act takes place
B_INST_NGA -> C_not_stated_ROLE_AGENCY : Report revenue and other receipts (FAR 5)
C_not_stated_ROLE_AGENCY -> E_SYS_AGENCY_OWN : use: Collections recorded in the books of the agency
C_not_stated_ROLE_AGENCY -> N_INST_BTR : F055 Quarterly report of revenue and other receipts (FAR 5), at…
@enduml
